        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="printf"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#printf"></a> printf</h2><p>printf函数位于头文件&lt;stdio.h&gt;内，是将内容打印至终端的函数<br />普通用法:</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;[string]&quot;</span>);</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>可以用占位符%s格式化输出</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;%s&quot;</span>,varname)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>占位符有:<a href="/2026/10/11/C%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80-%E5%8D%A0%E4%BD%8D%E7%AC%A6/" title="C语言-占位符">C语言-占位符</a></p>]]></content>
      
      
